 "description": "TEST SET 2: 51 new 200^3 crops ({'EFR': 11, 'EFS': 8, 'EMR': 8, 'EMS': 8, 'EOR': 8, 'EOS': 8}; 1 stratum cells skipped, see skipped_cells), same GT-free rule as test set 1 plus no overlap with any test-set-1 box. Defined in Phase 5i after the batos-paper-v3c freeze. Methods: v3 (200^3 probe) and v3c (re-cut window of native side round(200 r/10), scripts/cut_test2_v3c.py).",
 "created": "2026-11-10T20:13:25-03:00",
